OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,FLuke Littler dismantled Dirk van
OL,7,FDuijvenbode 17-5 to book his place in
OL,8,Fthe final of the World Matchplay in
OL,9,FBlackpool, where he will meet Gerwyn
OL,10,FPrice.
OL,12,FDouble world champion Littler is
OL,13,Faiming to defend his title at the
OL,14,FWinter Gardens and has been in sublime
OL,15,Fform on the back of consistent heavy
OL,16,Fscoring and clinical finishing.
OL,18,FLittler was soon on the front foot
OL,19,Fagain in Saturday's second semi-final,
OL,20,Fwith a break of throw in the opening
OL,21,Fleg before racing into a 4-0 lead.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
