PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1786452500
OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,FVan Duijvenbode had beaten Michael van
OL,7,FGerwen and then Gary Anderson to make
OL,8,Fthe World Matchplay semi-finals for
OL,9,Fthe first time. However, despite
OL,10,Flanding a 145 finish in the 11th leg,
OL,11,Fthe Dutchman looked in danger of being
OL,12,Fswept aside as Littler put the hammer
OL,13,Fdown.
OL,15,FLittler then landed a 130 checkout to
OL,16,Ftake a commanding 12-3 lead at the
OL,17,Finterval before moving to within one
OL,18,Fleg of victory by the time the players
OL,19,Fwent off again.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
