PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1786452500
OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,FAfter missing five match darts in the
OL,7,Fnext leg, Littler was then on a
OL,8,Fpotential nine-dart finish before
OL,9,Feventually taking out double 20 to
OL,10,Fwrap up another convincing victory,
OL,11,Fwith a match average of 110 after
OL,12,Flanding 16 maximums.
OL,14,F"I saw the average on the screen at
OL,15,Fone point of 117, but it was another
OL,16,Fgood performance, and it (the average)
OL,17,Fkeeps going up," Littler said on Sky
OL,18,FSports.
OL,26,@vD@AOUyD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
