FL,369,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1786452500
OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,F"I said to Dirk 'well played', it was
OL,7,Fa good tournament for himself, he has
OL,8,Fmade it to a major semi-final, so full
OL,9,Fcredit to him."
OL,11,FLittler, who has now become the first
OL,12,Fplayer ever to pass #3million in prize
OL,13,Fmoney on the PDC rankings, added: "I
OL,14,Fwas just more focused about the
OL,15,Fhighest average, which I shouldn't
OL,16,Fhave, but I am always having a look,
OL,17,Fbut we got the job done and it is back-
OL,18,Fto-back finals.
OL,20,F"I want to keep winning and stay at
OL,21,Fthe top, so I just have to keep going."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@OO]uD@cOU|D@AOU}D@gO]
