OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,FIn Saturday's opening semi-final at
OL,7,Fthe Winter Gardens, Price closed out a
OL,8,F17-10 win over world number three Gian
OL,9,Fvan Veen.
OL,11,FWelshman Price hit a 125 checkout to
OL,12,Ftake a 4-1 lead at the end of the
OL,13,Ffirst mini-session. Van Veen then
OL,14,Ffinally found some rhythm to reel off
OL,15,Fthree straight legs with two breaks
OL,16,Fahead of the next interval to close
OL,17,Fback to 6-4.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,369,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1786452500
OL,3,CLuke Littler reaches World Matchplay
OL,4,Cfinal
OL,6,FPrice, though, re-established control
OL,7,Fduring the second half of the contest
OL,8,Fas Van Veen's finishing, which had
OL,9,Fbeen solid earlier in the tournament,
OL,10,Ffaltered.
OL,12,FFour successive legs put Price 15-9
OL,13,Fahead before the Welshman clinched a
OL,14,Fdominant victory when he pinned double
OL,15,Ftop.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
